{"ticker":"SWK","updated":"2026-11-20T23:21:16Z","profile":{"longName":"Stanley Black & Decker, Inc.","shortName":"Stanley Black & Decker, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Tools & Accessories","country":"United States","website":"https://www.stanleyblackanddecker.com","fullTimeEmployees":43500,"marketCap":15853991936,"trailingPE":19.107527,"forwardPE":16.203451,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.0414294,"pegRatio":1.39,"targetMeanPrice":115.27273,"targetHighPrice":140.0,"targetLowPrice":96.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":11,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.007,"earningsGrowth":4.388,"grossMargins":0.32157,"operatingMargins":0.07646,"profitMargins":0.05526,"totalRevenue":15223300096,"beta":1.158,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":122.68,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":62.7,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.12},"summary":"Stanley Black & Decker, Inc. provides hand tools, power tools, outdoor products, and related accessories in the United States, Canada, Other Americas, Europe, and Asia. Its Tools & Outdoor segment offers professional grade corded and cordless electric power tools and equipment, including drills, impact wrenches and drivers, grinders, saws, routers, concrete prep and placement tools, and sanders; pneumatic tools and fasteners; corded and cordless electric power tools; household power tools, hand-held vacuums, and small appliances; leveling and layout tools, planes, hammers, demolition tools, clamps, vises, knives, saws, chisels, and industrial and automotive tools; drill, screwdriver, router bits, abrasives, saw blades, and threading products; tool boxes, sawhorses, medical cabinets, and engineered storage solutions; and electric and gas-powered lawn and garden products. This segment sells its products under the DEWALT, CRAFTSMAN, CUB CADET, STANLEY, BLACK+DECKER, and HUSTLER brands through retailers, third-party distributors, independent dealers, and a direct sales force. Its Industrial segment provides threaded fasteners, blind rivets and tools, blind inserts and tools, drawn arc weld studs and systems, engineered plastic and mechanical fasteners, self-piercing riveting systems, precision nut running systems, micro fasteners, high-strength structural fasteners, axel swage, lat","summary_zh":"Stanley Black & Decker, Inc. 在美國、加拿大、其他美洲、歐洲和亞洲提供手動工具、電動工具、戶外產品和相關配件。其工具和戶外部門提供專業級有線和無線電動工具和設備，包括鑽頭、衝擊扳手和起子、磨床、鋸、刳刨機、混凝土準備和澆築工具以及打磨機；氣動工具和緊固件；有線和無線電動工具；家用電動工具、手持式吸塵器和小家電；調平和佈局工具、刨刀、錘子、拆卸工具、夾子、虎鉗、刀、鋸、鑿子以及工業和汽車工具；鑽頭、螺絲起子、銑刀、磨料、鋸片和螺紋產品；工具箱、鋸木架、醫療櫃和工程儲存解決方案；以及電動和燃氣驅動的草坪和花園產品。該部門透過零售商、第三方經銷商、獨立經銷商和直銷隊伍以 DEWALT、CRAFTSMAN、CUB CADET、STANLEY、BLACK+DECKER 和 HUSTLER 品牌銷售其產品。其工業部門提供螺紋緊固件、盲鉚釘和工具、盲鑲件和工具、拉弧焊螺柱和系統、工程塑料和機械緊固件、自衝鉚接系統、精密螺母運行系統、微型緊固件、高強度結構緊固件、軸模、拉桿","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"工具及配件","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":76.67,"h":76.67,"l":74.7,"c":75.02,"v":2351800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":75.63,"h":76.76,"l":75.07,"c":75.27,"v":1243300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":75.02,"h":75.96,"l":74.89,"c":75.09,"v":1160800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":74.11,"h":74.53,"l":73.08,"c":73.45,"v":1188500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":73.45,"h":73.88,"l":72.81,"c":73.85,"v":1790700},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":74.52,"h":74.52,"l":73.07,"c":73.9,"v":1247000},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":74.19,"h":74.41,"l":73.05,"c":74.33,"v":1135300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":73.9,"h":75.11,"l":72.55,"c":73.62,"v":1664400},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":74.05,"h":75.94,"l":73.68,"c":74.04,"v":1312300},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":74.26,"h":75.97,"l":74.26,"c":75.42,"v":1854500},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":75.94,"h":75.94,"l":73.57,"c":74.35,"v":1265000},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":74.58,"h":74.98,"l":73.05,"c":73.19,"v":1311600},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":73.38,"h":74.01,"l":72.63,"c":72.74,"v":1372000},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":72.35,"h":72.35,"l":69.25,"c":69.72,"v":2385400},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":70.32,"h":70.34,"l":64.25,"c":64.43,"v":4777500},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":65.53,"h":66.35,"l":64.44,"c":64.49,"v":2261000},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":63.24,"h":67.38,"l":63.2,"c":67.02,"v":2620500},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":68